### 查询 Vendor 采购订单
POST {{baseUrl}}/amazon/vendor-orders/purchase-orders/list
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
tenant-id: {{adminTenantId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"shopId":1,"countryCode":"US","query":{"createdAfter":"2026-08-01T00:00:00Z","limit":"20","includeDetails":"true"}}

### 查询 Vendor 采购订单详情
POST {{baseUrl}}/amazon/vendor-orders/purchase-orders/get
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
tenant-id: {{adminTenantId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"shopId":1,"countryCode":"US","purchaseOrderNumber":"058-1234567-1234567"}

### 提交 Vendor 采购订单确认
POST {{baseUrl}}/amazon/vendor-orders/acknowledgements/submit
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
tenant-id: {{adminTenantId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"shopId":1,"countryCode":"US","body":{"acknowledgements":[{"purchaseOrderNumber":"058-1234567-1234567","acknowledgementDate":"2026-08-08T08:00:00Z","sellingParty":{"partyId":"VENDOR_CODE"},"items":[]}]}}

### 查询 Vendor 采购订单状态
POST {{baseUrl}}/amazon/vendor-orders/purchase-orders/status
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
tenant-id: {{adminTenantId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"shopId":1,"countryCode":"US","query":{"createdAfter":"2026-08-01T00:00:00Z","limit":"20"}}
